// ?Rva009B46E0ReadBits@@YAHPAURva009B46E0State@@H@Z
// partial score=0.35 date=2026-09-10
// cl: /O2 /Ob0 /DNDEBUG /DWIN32 /D_WINDOWS /MD
// VP6 bit-field reader at retail 0x009B46E0, exact boundary 94 bytes.
//
// The decoder at 0x009B4A10 calls this file-static helper with the reader in
// EAX and the requested width in ECX.  That is MSVC 7.1's internal-linkage
// convention, not __fastcall.  Keeping the helper static and giving the
// compiler a TU-local call reproduces the register entry while the body stays
// ordinary C++.

